    skos:note "Proposed from the cirpass2-textile reverse-coverage run of 2026-10-30 to cover cirpass2-textile:UserAcceptanceCondition. Captures the post‑repair user acceptance aspect, distinct from repairability metrics."@en ;
    skos:closeMatch <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-repairability#UserAcceptanceCondition> .

eutex:UserAcceptanceStatusConcept
